"""voipctl - manage the outbound-only VoIP server.

Everything under /etc/voip is the source of truth. `voipctl apply` validates
it and regenerates the Asterisk, nftables and fail2ban configuration from it.
Run `voipctl --help` for the command list, or see /root/README.
"""

